  "system": {
    "category": "feature",
    "source": "Bad Eden (2024 rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<div data-ft-canon-human=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"The first thing worth defending was the circle of people who decided, against all sense, to keep each other warm through the night.\"</em></p><p><strong>First Fire (1/Soma Break).</strong> Spend 10 minutes building a coalition fire — a real one, not a metaphor. While it burns and creatures shelter within 6 squares (up to 1 hour, longer if tended):</p><ul><li><p>Friendly creatures reroll the lowest die on defense checks against being Shaken or Stressed.</p></li><li><p>After a Soma Break taken at the fire, each friendly creature present gains a single banked reroll-lowest they may spend on any check before the next Soma Break.</p></li><li><p>The first time any hostile creature crosses within 6 squares, every friendly creature there knows it.</p></li><li><p>The fire counts as a defensible camp narratively.</p></li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"humCroMagnonFirstFire\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>First Fire (Cro-Magnon)</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> 10-min build  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Build a coalition fire — 6 squares shelter zone for up to 1 hour granting friend reroll-lowest vs Shaken/Stressed, +1 Integrity/Hit Die at the fire, hostile-crossing alarm, narrative defensible camp.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
